{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/4a2d285d848ed2fa859c376a2455fe75.avif?t=1758665863\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clustercluck: Dawn Cluck Mode</strong> is a chaotic social deduction and survival game where chickens and foxes clash in the deadliest barnyard showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of innocent chickens must work together to rescue chicks, unlock shelters, and survive the night\u2014while secretly hiding among them are cunning foxes in disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round splits into two phases:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discussion &amp; Voting:</strong> When a chicken is found dead, all gather in the coop to argue, accuse, and vote. If the wrong chicken is hanged, the foxes grow stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action &amp; Survival:</strong> Outside the coop, chickens race to find chicks, open shelters, and escape\u2026 while foxes hunt them down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues in scattered chests to uncover the truth about who the killers might be. Special roles such as the <strong>Seer, Guardian,</strong> and <strong>Wizard</strong> can turn the tide of the game\u2014if they\u2019re used wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you save the chicks and expose the foxes, or deceive the flock and feast under the dawn?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.poster.avif?t=1758665863\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.webm?t=1758665863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.mp4?t=1758665863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736680?t=1758665863","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/7a1789ca97bfb44928085b622115e3e066199d42/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758665863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/264ff5dc42ce8b1b528ecd7f3f1a7be4e637ced0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758665863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/264ff5dc42ce8b1b528ecd7f3f1a7be4e637ced0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758665863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Cosmetics Update!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/b3649c7215d5e77dbef720e4b2091bfb.avif?t=1758665863\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>\ud83d\udc14\u2728 <strong>Cosmetic Update!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickens can now show off their style! Earn in-game currency just by playing, then spend it in the market to unlock hilarious hats, flashy outfits, and more. Customize</p></p><br><h1>The ClusterCluck DISCORD Server is LIVE!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/8e2caf8a1b929b07d9ebe2fb934a5dc4.avif?t=1758665863\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>\ud83c\udf89 The ClusterCluck Discord Server is Live! \ud83d\udc14</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re excited to announce that the official <strong>ClusterCluck Discord server</strong> is now open!<br>Join our growing community to stay up to date with development news, share feedback, connect with other players, and be a part of the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>What\u2019s Inside?</strong><br>\u2022 Dev updates and patch notes<br>\u2022 Tips, tricks, and strategies<br>\u2022 Community events and discussions<br>\u2022 Feedback &amp; bug report channels<br>\u2022 And plenty of chicken-fueled mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Your voice matters.</strong><br>Whether you\u2019ve got suggestions, bug reports, or just want to share a funny in-game moment \u2014 we\u2019d love to hear from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you there!<br>\u2014 The ClusterCluck Team</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/4a2d285d848ed2fa859c376a2455fe75.avif?t=1758665863\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clustercluck: Dawn Cluck Mode</strong> is a chaotic social deduction and survival game where chickens and foxes clash in the deadliest barnyard showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of innocent chickens must work together to rescue chicks, unlock shelters, and survive the night\u2014while secretly hiding among them are cunning foxes in disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round splits into two phases:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discussion &amp; Voting:</strong> When a chicken is found dead, all gather in the coop to argue, accuse, and vote. If the wrong chicken is hanged, the foxes grow stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action &amp; Survival:</strong> Outside the coop, chickens race to find chicks, open shelters, and escape\u2026 while foxes hunt them down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues in scattered chests to uncover the truth about who the killers might be. Special roles such as the <strong>Seer, Guardian,</strong> and <strong>Wizard</strong> can turn the tide of the game\u2014if they\u2019re used wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you save the chicks and expose the foxes, or deceive the flock and feast under the dawn?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.poster.avif?t=1758665863\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.webm?t=1758665863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.mp4?t=1758665863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["GlintzGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/4dea4c11f7091fc4f2dcb94142628906e44405cf/header.jpg?t=1758665863","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"ClusterCluck","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10-11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><str